{"id":"59f2769e44131c6a","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-logical-consequence.md","title":"语义后承","display":"df-logical-consequence — 语义后承","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-logical-consequence","aliases":["56-df-logical-consequence"],"display":"df-logical-consequence — 语义后承","depends_on":["[[56-df-satisfaction]]","[[56-df-sentence]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-logical-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-logical-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logical-consequence — 语义后承"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b86695d5c9cd5ac\" href=\"?note=2b86695d5c9cd5ac\" title=\"56-df-sentence\">56-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>给定一阶语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)\">\\(L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)\">\\(\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，句子集合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b86695d5c9cd5ac\" href=\"?note=2b86695d5c9cd5ac\" title=\"56-df-sentence\">56-df-sentence</a>。</li>\n<li>结构解释与满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a>。下面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 在集合论元语言中取遍非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\">\\(I,J\\)</span> 分别在该载体的函数解释族与关系解释族中量化；不构造所有结构组成的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F_L}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)}}\\;\n\\forall J\\in\\prod_{P\\in P_L}\\mathcal P(A^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\;\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\bigl(\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;((A,I,J)\\models\\psi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow(A,I,J)\\models\\varphi\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F_L}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)}}\\;\n\\forall J\\in\\prod_{P\\in P_L}\\mathcal P(A^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\;\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\bigl(\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;((A,I,J)\\models\\psi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow(A,I,J)\\models\\varphi\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\models_L\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\models_L\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处明确区分语法中的量词与定义满足关系时的元语言量词。原书 §7.1 的等式有效性是本语义后承在等式语言、全称封闭等式上的特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"2b86695d5c9cd5ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"2b86695d5c9cd5ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定一阶语言 $L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)$；$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，句子集合见 [[56-df-sentence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"结构解释与满足关系见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。下面 $A$ 在集合论元语言中取遍非空集合，$I,J$ 分别在该载体的函数解释族与关系解释族中量化；不构造所有结构组成的集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"I,J","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F_L}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)}}\\;\n\\forall J\\in\\prod_{P\\in P_L}\\mathcal P(A^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\;\n\\Bigl(&\\bigl(\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;((A,I,J)\\models\\psi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\Longrightarrow(A,I,J)\\models\\varphi\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\models_L\\varphi.","display":true}],"bytes":1595,"backlinks":[{"id":"75f38e468e1b4620","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)$，设 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)$ 与语义后承见 [[56-df-logical-consequence]]。本节点采用语义闭合的理论约定；$\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-logical-consequence.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b729ff69dbfa830d","2b86695d5c9cd5ac"]}